{"text":"As you leave here today, I'd like to leave you with a very personal message, which is what it is that I believe we should be doing as individuals. And this is really about being open-minded. Open-minded to the fact that our hopes and dreams of creating prosperity for people around the world, creating and meaningfully putting a dent in poverty for hundreds of millions of people has to be based in being open-minded. Because these systems have good things and they have bad things. Just to illustrate, I went into my annals of myself. That's a picture of me. Aww. I was born and raised in Zambia in 1969. At the time of my birth, blacks were not issued birth certificates, and that law only changed in 1973. This is an affidavit from the Zambian government.","words":[{"text":"As","start":0.0,"end":0.84},{"text":"you","start":0.84,"end":1.02},{"text":"leave","start":1.02,"end":1.2},{"text":"here","start":1.2,"end":1.42},{"text":"today","start":1.42,"end":1.82,"punct":","},{"text":"I'd","start":2.44,"end":2.6},{"text":"like","start":2.6,"end":2.74},{"text":"to","start":2.74,"end":2.92},{"text":"leave","start":2.92,"end":3.14},{"text":"you","start":3.14,"end":3.44},{"text":"with","start":3.44,"end":3.82},{"text":"a","start":3.82,"end":3.94},{"text":"very","start":3.94,"end":4.08},{"text":"personal","start":4.08,"end":4.6},{"text":"message","start":4.6,"end":5.08,"punct":","},{"text":"which","start":5.5,"end":5.64},{"text":"is","start":5.64,"end":5.8},{"text":"what","start":5.8,"end":6.32},{"text":"it","start":6.32,"end":6.46},{"text":"is","start":6.46,"end":6.66},{"text":"that","start":6.66,"end":6.82},{"text":"I","start":6.82,"end":7.06},{"text":"believe","start":7.06,"end":7.34},{"text":"we","start":7.34,"end":7.68},{"text":"should","start":7.68,"end":7.86},{"text":"be","start":7.86,"end":8.02},{"text":"doing","start":8.02,"end":8.2},{"text":"as","start":8.2,"end":8.44},{"text":"individuals","start":8.44,"end":8.88,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":10.02,"end":10.08